OL,3,GNEWSABoys, 12 and 14, arrested over
OL,4,Amajor fire in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo boys have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of arson after a major fire
OL,8,Fleft a listed building in Nottingham
OL,9,Fcity centre at risk of internal
OL,10,Fcollapse.
OL,12,FAt its height, 12 fire crews and about
OL,13,F60 firefighters were tackling the blaze
OL,14,Fat the Grade II listed Escobar building
OL,15,Fin Market Street shortly before 23:00
OL,16,FBST on Monday. No-one was seriously
OL,17,Finjured, police said.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
