OL,3,GNEWSABoys, 12 and 14, arrested over
OL,4,Amajor fire in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FClosures were put in place in Upper
OL,7,FParliament Street, Goldsmith Street,
OL,8,FMarket Street and the surrounding area,
OL,9,Fwith a joint police and fire
OL,10,Finvestigation under way.
OL,12,FPolice said the boys - 12 and 14 -
OL,13,Fremained in custody.
